                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I didn't expect to enjoy TOEM this much! The characters are fun, the quests are entertaining, and the game has a cozy atmosphere with a little chaos here and there. The quests are also fairly straightforward, so you can figure out pretty much everything on your own without getting stuck. My only real complaint is that there's no night mode, so I ended up playing TOEM during the day instead. It was really thoughtful of the developers to add Basto as a thank-you, and I especially loved the nighttime atmosphere there. I just wish we could experience it throughout the whole game! A lovely little adventure that surprised me in the best way. 🖤\n\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3820167532",
